        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://beckdc.com/historical-places-in-venersborg/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Reconstructed Hudson’s Bay Company Fort Vancouver in Venersborg marks the site of an early trading post that shaped regional commerce.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        22,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://beckdc.com/historical-places-in-venersborg/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Venersborg’s landscape was originally heavily timbered, a fact that influenced early settlement and logging activities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
